{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1157","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Maximum Balanced Circle"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$n$$$ people in a row. The height of the $$$i$$$-th person is $$$a_i$$$. You can choose "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"any"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" subset of these people and try to arrange them into a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"balanced circle"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"balanced circle"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is such an order of people that the difference between heights of any adjacent people is no more than $$$1$$$. For example, let heights of chosen people be $$$[a_{i_1}, a_{i_2}, \\dots, a_{i_k}]$$$, where $$$k$$$ is the number of people you choose. Then the condition $$$|a_{i_j} - a_{i_{j + 1}}| \\le 1$$$ should be satisfied for all $$$j$$$ from $$$1$$$ to $$$k-1$$$ and the condition $$$|a_{i_1} - a_{i_k}| \\le 1$$$ should be also satisfied. $$$|x|$$$ means the absolute value of $$$x$$$. It is obvious that the circle consisting of one person is balanced."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to choose the maximum number of people and construct a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"balanced circle"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" consisting of all chosen people. It is obvious that the circle consisting of one person is balanced so the answer always exists."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of people."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of the input contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$), where $$$a_i$$$ is the height of the $$$i$$$-th person."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first line of the output print $$$k$$$ — the number of people in the maximum "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"balanced circle"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second line print $$$k$$$ integers $$$res_1, res_2, \\dots, res_k$$$, where $$$res_j$$$ is the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"height"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the $$$j$$$-th person in the maximum "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"balanced circle"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". The condition $$$|res_{j} - res_{j + 1}| \\le 1$$$ should be satisfied for all $$$j$$$ from $$$1$$$ to $$$k-1$$$ and the condition $$$|res_{1} - res_{k}| \\le 1$$$ should be also satisfied."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n4 3 5 1 2 2 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n2 1 1 2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n3 7 5 1 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n5 5 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n5 1 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n4 5 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n2 2 3 2 1 2 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n1 2 2 2 2 3 2 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1157F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1157/problem/F"}